 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: organize photos by capture date and find exact duplicates
 Photo Organizer scans a selected directory, identifies byte-for-byte
 duplicate photos, and arranges unique images in year/month folders based
 on their capture date. Extra duplicate copies are moved aside.
